proppi@veeble.han.sub.org (Paul Lenz) writes:

>When I die - how great is the probability that it will be a ghost level?

If you die at dungeonlevel 3 or earlier, there will NOT be a ghost level.
If you go beyond that, it's 1/3 probability.

>When I start a new game - how great is the probability that I get 
>that ghost level?

When you descend to the level with a bones file, it's again 1/3 probability
to get the ghost level.
